OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTurning
OL,6,Frather cloudy during the evening with
OL,7,Fa few showers crossing from the west.
OL,8,FAngus and the Fife coast then becoming
OL,9,Fmainly dry with clear spells
OL,10,Fovernight, while a few showers
OL,11,Fcontinue to affect Stirlingshire and
OL,12,FPerthshire. Breezy at times.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FA bright day with sunny spells
OL,15,Fand a few showers, which could be
OL,16,Fquite heavy in the west. Fresh to
OL,17,Fstrong west or southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
