OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fwith scattered showers and easing
OL,7,Fwinds on Saturday. Windy with a few
OL,8,Fshowers on Sunday. Bright start Monday
OL,9,Fthen increasingly heavy showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
